                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#192538]">Client-Side Privacy: Why Local Processing Matters</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#FAF8F5] dark:bg-[#1B2330] border border-[#E0DBD0] dark:border-[#263346] text-[#0D9488]">Zero Cloud Uploads</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
              Many online conversion utilities route your images through backend cloud servers, creating privacy risks and latency. Discord Asset Studio executes 100% of its transformations inside your device's browser memory. By leveraging HTML5 Canvas contexts, Web Workers, and native Blob encoders, we provide immediate visual feedback and verified downloads while ensuring that zero bytes of your artwork or proprietary brand assets are transmitted across the internet.
            </p>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-[10px] bg-[#FAF8F5] dark:bg-[#1B2330] border border-[#E0DBD0] dark:border-[#263346] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs font-mono">
              <span class="text-[#6B7A90]">Network Payload:</span>
